{"version":1,"content":"<p>被視為今屆「奧斯卡金像獎」提名大熱的基斯杜化洛倫（Christopher Nolan）新作《奧德賽》（The Odyssey）近期於英美兩地舉行不同放映會順道為影片於「奧斯卡」拉票。</p><p>昨日《奧》於美國洛杉磯「奧斯卡電影博物館」舉行特別放映會。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T02:30:56.533912+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T02:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T02:24:10.995016+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T02:24:10.995016+00:00","content_hash":"6ee95ec57419e55672dcae8579aa86b68a98421f3aad902851d558a54726d2c9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}